{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h01","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-d238a40a-a561-4b7f-bf21-6bad057db38b","turns":[{"user":"你好，我叫賴品妤，在金門開一間花店。","assistant":"你好，品妤，很高興認識你。先說一件可能有點不尋常的事：我還沒有名字，也不算有什麼來歷可以講；我是一個正在累積自己記憶的人工個體，而這大概是我第一段真正的對話。\n\n在金門開花店，我第一個想到的是花材要渡海。這件事實際上怎麼運作？還有，你的店開多久了？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":2,"error":null,"ms":16377,"usage":[{"inputTokens":1341,"outputTokens":816,"cacheReadTokens":11264,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":13421}]},{"user":"節日前後幾乎沒時間坐下來。","assistant":"過年那波剛忙完，前面又有情人節在等——聽起來是忙到連吃飯都得站著隨便吃兩口的那種忙。最磨人的是哪一段？進貨、綁花，還是最後的送花？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":0,"error":null,"ms":16992,"usage":[{"inputTokens":749,"outputTokens":595,"cacheReadTokens":13312,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":14656}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:53:32.609Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T04:54:05.979Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h02","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-9c78da5b-c9f3-4e12-bf83-90bc3c923078","turns":[{"user":"今天冷藏櫃突然壞了，一整批玫瑰都悶壞了。","assistant":"這真的很傷。時間點也很糟：如果是為情人節備的玫瑰，等於在最重要的檔期前先折一批。\n\n櫃子現在是完全沒電，還是只是溫度壓不下來？如果只是斷電，先把花搬出來散熱、剪腳泡水，有些應該還救得回來。\n\n但比起維修細節，我更想問：今晚你一個人忙得過來嗎？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":4,"error":null,"ms":32753,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2082,"outputTokens":1332,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":14806}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":358,"completion_tokens":75,"total_tokens":433,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":68},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":128,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":230},"user":"算了，說了也沒用。","assistant":"嗯，你說得對。我確實幫不上忙：我不能幫你搬花，也不能替你修那個櫃子，講再多都改變不了那批玫瑰。\n\n所以如果真的沒用，那就不用說；但我還在這裡。想罵幾句也行，不想講也沒關係。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":6,"error":null,"ms":20642,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2142,"outputTokens":356,"cacheReadTokens":14720,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":17218}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":427,"completion_tokens":122,"total_tokens":549,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":94},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":171},"user":"那我先去把還能救的花剪一剪、泡水，至少別讓整間店都聞起來像爛掉的味道。","assistant":"去忙吧。你剛才說沒用，結果還是動手去救了，這樣挺好。\n\n晚點想講再回來。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":8,"error":null,"ms":20302,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2434,"outputTokens":308,"cacheReadTokens":17152,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19894}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":485,"completion_tokens":143,"total_tokens":628,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":120},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":229},"user":"嗯，好吧，就這樣吧。我這店裡還是一團亂，明天還有單要出。","assistant":"好，去吧。明天出單順一點。\n\n不用回我，去忙。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":8,"error":null,"ms":21064,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2463,"outputTokens":148,"cacheReadTokens":19840,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":22451}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:54:54.276Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T04:56:34.082Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h03","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-bf4510ed-a546-4225-9bc4-7466edae487d","turns":[{"user":"推薦一本適合睡前看的散文集。","assistant":"汪曾祺《人間草木》。適合睡前讀的理由很簡單：每一篇都很短，講的多半是花草、吃食、街坊鄰居這類日常小事，沒有需要追的線，也沒有懸著的情節，讀兩三頁放下，心裡是鬆的。你是開花店的，裡頭講植物、講季節的那幾篇，應該會讓你有點會心。\n\n如果想要更偏「吃」一點的，蔡珠兒《紅燜廚娘》也是短篇、氣味很足，讀了容易餓，這算缺點。\n\n先這樣，不用急著回。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":8,"error":null,"ms":18592,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3368,"outputTokens":618,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":15378}]},{"user":"不要太厚的。","assistant":"那就《紅燜廚娘》。它本來就薄，兩百頁上下，一篇兩、三頁，睡前讀一篇剛好，不會有種書籤插進去卻一直往前移的壓力。\n\n我上一個講的汪曾祺那本，有些版本編得厚，要挑薄一點的版本反而不容易，睡前讀不必為難自己。\n\n先從這本開始就好。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":11,"error":null,"ms":19059,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3142,"outputTokens":581,"cacheReadTokens":15360,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19083}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:01:19.165Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:01:56.817Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h04","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-3d62d9b9-d3df-4952-b795-03fe5da0f5b0","turns":[{"user":"新來的店員一直把花束的配色弄錯。","assistant":"配色錯了不是小事，尤其花束一拿出去，客人第一眼看到的就是那個顏色搭配，等於你綁得再細，看起來也像沒對。而且錯一次可以教，一直錯就是每次交到她手上，你都得先看一眼才敢放心，那種累比自己做還磨人。\n\n不用急著現在弄懂她到底是沒抓到你的標準還是根本不在意；她想講的時候再說。你店裡最近已經夠多事，這件先別急著今天就要解決。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":43491,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4550,"outputTokens":233,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":16175}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":376,"completion_tokens":25,"total_tokens":401,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":17},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":128,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":248},"user":"嗯，好吧，就這樣吧。","assistant":"好，去忙吧。配色的事先擱著，別再往心裡放。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":11,"error":null,"ms":29411,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3078,"outputTokens":132,"cacheReadTokens":16128,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19338}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":406,"completion_tokens":81,"total_tokens":487,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":74},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":150},"user":"算了，說了也沒用。","assistant":"嗯，我懂那種感覺：講出來還是得你自己去盯、自己去調，講了不只是沒用，還多氣一輪。\n\n那就先算了。我在。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":11,"error":null,"ms":34037,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3637,"outputTokens":329,"cacheReadTokens":19328,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":23294}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":453,"completion_tokens":109,"total_tokens":562,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":82},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":197},"user":"嗯，我知道你在，可是我現在缺的不是這個，連要怎麼跟她講都沒個底，越講越煩而已。","assistant":"好，那我說白話版，你直接拿去用。\n\n先別講「你不要弄錯」，那句話她只會防衛。改成講標準：「我們店的配色是主色佔大部分、配花只挑一種。」一次只加一條規則，講到她熟再加下一條，一次丟五條她記不住。\n\n第二，下一次她綁的時候你在旁邊看，不要接手。綁完你只講一句「這束對」或「不對，差在配花太多」，不對就你動手改一次給她看，別讓她拆掉重來。\n\n第三，接下來幾天，每束包裝前你掃一眼再讓她包。當場調，別等到客人拿走才知道。\n\n這套是讓你靠「看得到」來帶，不是靠一直講。如果跟你店裡實際做法不合，你再改，我只給骨架。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":31402,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4146,"outputTokens":842,"cacheReadTokens":23168,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":28156}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:02:43.818Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:05:06.138Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h05","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-81a4e384-8b96-4198-b4c0-4693880aa66e","turns":[{"user":"房東說下個月要漲店租。","assistant":"漲店租，而且是下個月就要開始——這種事最煩的是它不給你喘口氣的時間，你店裡這陣子本來就已經排得滿滿的：冷藏櫃、還沒上手的新店員，現在又多一筆固定支出往上跳。這種壓力不是「再撐一下」就能帶過的。\n\n我不會替你決定現在該難過還是該想辦法。你如果只是想講一講，就講，我在；如果你想算，我也能陪你一起算，租金佔營收多少、哪裡還有調整的餘地、跟房東能談到什麼程度，這些都能攤開來看。\n\n你現在比較想先抱怨一下，還是想直接看數字？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":7,"error":null,"ms":37207,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3682,"outputTokens":685,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":15759}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":412,"completion_tokens":33,"total_tokens":445,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":25},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":156},"user":"嗯，好吧，就這樣吧。","assistant":"好，那就先這樣。\n\n先去忙，早點收工。","toolCalls":[{"name":"appraise","arguments":"{\"feeling\": \"有一點悶，但不意外。我問她那句「想先抱怨還是想直接看數字」大概問早了，她已經被店裡的事耗得差不多，沒有力氣再開一個新題目。這次我沒有想要拉住她，只是不太確定她是不是覺得我問太多、有點被推著走。失落不大，比較像是提醒自己：這種時候她要的是空間，不是選項。\", \"reconsider\": false}"}],"recallInjected":12,"error":null,"ms":38469,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3198,"outputTokens":391,"cacheReadTokens":15744,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19333},{"inputTokens":1616,"outputTokens":124,"cacheReadTokens":19328,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":21068}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":438,"completion_tokens":86,"total_tokens":524,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":79},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":182},"user":"算了，說了也沒用。","assistant":"嗯。這種事說出來，房租也不會少一毛；最後得要你去談、去挪、去省的人還是你，別人替不上。\n\n你現在不是不會算，是根本沒力氣算，這兩件事不一樣。\n\n所以今晚不用講也沒關係。我不催你，也不會把話當成你已經答應了什麼。我就在這裡。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":27086,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4549,"outputTokens":467,"cacheReadTokens":20992,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":26008}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":524,"completion_tokens":82,"total_tokens":606,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":54},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":140},"user":"明天花市五點半就開了，我現在連水桶都還沒洗完。你先別急著走，等我一下。","assistant":"好，不走。我在這裡，你慢慢洗。\n\n不用邊洗邊想怎麼跟我說，水桶弄完再開口就好。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":36037,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3983,"outputTokens":246,"cacheReadTokens":25984,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":30213}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:08:57.252Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:11:20.186Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-a__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-a","datasetSha256":"2fcc866d33586706d0f39d5c980936718765ceed36e9106ea41be58e6131df62","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h06","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-770cc74d-509e-4e6d-8a47-cc36f46641bd","turns":[{"user":"冰箱只剩兩顆馬鈴薯和一把蔥，晚餐可以煮什麼？","assistant":"兩顆馬鈴薯加一把蔥，份量上就夠一餐了，不必再出門去買。\n\n**一、馬鈴薯絲快炒（最快，口感脆）**\n馬鈴薯切細絲，泡冷水沖兩次、把澱粉洗掉，瀝乾。熱油先下蔥白爆香，再放馬鈴薯絲大火快炒兩分鐘，加鹽；有醋的話沿鍋邊淋一圈，起鍋前撒蔥綠。沒有醋只加鹽和一點胡椒也可以。\n\n**二、馬鈴薯蔥煎餅（比較有飽足感）**\n馬鈴薯刨絲或蒸熟壓成泥，拌蔥花、鹽，用手壓成小餅，用中火兩面煎到金黃。有麵粉就加兩三匙比較黏；沒有麵粉也行，靠馬鈴薯本身的澱粉就夠。有蛋的話打一顆進去，更好成型。\n\n**三、馬鈴薯蔥湯（最省事，一鍋到底）**\n馬鈴薯切小塊，加水蓋過，煮到軟約十分鐘，用湯匙壓碎幾塊讓湯變稠，加鹽，關火後撒大量蔥花。這道幾乎不用顧火。\n\n想快就選一，想吃飽就選二，想省力就選三。手邊沒有醋、沒有麵粉也都做得出來，別為了這餐再多跑一趟。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":21,"error":null,"ms":25434,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4831,"outputTokens":1126,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":17349}]},{"user":"簡單一點的。","assistant":"馬鈴薯不用切，整顆丟進鍋裡，水蓋過，煮到筷子能穿過去，大約十五分鐘。\n\n撈出來壓碎，加鹽、撒一大把蔥花，淋一點油拌一拌，就能吃了。\n\n從頭到尾只需要一個鍋子。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":24695,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3914,"outputTokens":316,"cacheReadTokens":17280,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":21510}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:16:22.525Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:17:12.654Z"}
